-- #1812. `zmodI` is imported ALIAS-QUALIFIED and BEFORE `amodI`; that ordering makes
-- `medaka check` exit 0 with zero diagnostics while `run` and `build` both correctly
-- reject the same program. See claim.txt: three of the six orderings of these same
-- three imports are silent, and they are exactly the ones where zmodI precedes amodI.
import zmodI as Z
import fmodI.{mth}
import amodI.{af}

main = println (mth "abc" 5 + af 0 + Z.zf 0)
